      "Viral hepatitis is liver inflammation from the **five hepatotropic viruses A to E**: **A and E are faeco-oral, acute and never chronic** (E kills 15-25% of women in the third trimester), while **B, C and D are blood-borne and become chronic**, driving cirrhosis and liver cancer - India's **NVHCP** gives free testing, **tenofovir for hepatitis B** and a 12-week curative **sofosbuvir-velpatasvir** course for hepatitis C.",
